{"id": "t108-017", "text": "Remember Sophie said her husband Patrick retires in December, after 35 years teaching chemistry. Big party planned for Saturday 12 December 2026 at the cricket club, she's organising it all and stressing about the guest list. He wants to do woodwork when he's done, she reckons a set of chisels would go down well. Should get a card the week before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Patrick", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retires", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "35 years teaching chemistry", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday 12 December 2026", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing about the guest list", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "woodwork", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "when he's done"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "a set of chisels would go down well", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
