{"id": "t108-019", "text": "reggie mentioned his nan's 90th is this weekend, whole family going up to Durham", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "reggie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "90th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going up to Durham", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t108-020", "text": "Amir left his job at the bank last Friday. Going back to study architecture in September 2027, he got the place at the Bartlett. Wants to be a set designer eventually, has done some bits for an amateur theatre. His partner Oliver is covering the rent for now. Said he should have done it ten years ago. Don't forget to send him that book on stage design.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "left his job at the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Going back to study architecture", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "place at the Bartlett", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wants to be a set designer", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "has done some bits for an amateur theatre", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "ten years ago"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him that book on stage design", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t108-022", "text": "Catalina - started at the vet practice Monday. Her cat Pepper went with her for a checkup on day one, which she thought was hilarious. Kavya (her sister) is apparently jealous of the staff discount.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Catalina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "started at the vet practice", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "checkup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "day one", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "jealous of the staff discount", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t108-027", "text": "Talked to Rhys at football. He's been passed over for the promotion again, third time this year. Pretty fed up, thinking about leaving altogether. Might look at the fire service, applications open in January 2027 and there's a fitness test in March. His girlfriend Moira thinks he should just go for it. His dad was a firefighter so it runs in the family I guess. Check in with him next week, he seemed low.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed over for the promotion", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Pretty fed up", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking about leaving altogether", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Might look at the fire service", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applications", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fitness test", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Moira", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "was a firefighter", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check in with him", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "low", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t108-033", "text": "Hana's moving to Lisbon in March 2027 with her girlfriend, both found remote jobs", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Lisbon", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "remote jobs", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t108-036", "text": "Chidi's wife Yasmin had the baby on Tuesday! Little girl, Ada. Both doing well. need to get a gift before we visit next weekend", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chidi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yasmin", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Little girl", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ada", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing well", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a gift", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visit", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next weekend", "anchor": "e2"}]}
