{"id": "t108-046", "text": "Seo-yeon got a place on the graduate scheme at Suzuki, starting September 2027. Remind me to send her flowers this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "place on the graduate scheme at Suzuki", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starting", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her flowers", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t108-048", "text": "Catalina said her partner's leaving party on Saturday is off because he got the job extended another six months. So no party but good news.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Catalina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the job extended another six months", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}]}
{"id": "t108-050", "text": "Abebe's son starts uni in Glasgow next Sunday, doing engineering. The whole family's driving him up on Saturday, then his wife is staying an extra few days to settle him in. Abebe says he's fine about it but he went very quiet when I asked. Also mentioned work want him to move to the Leeds site in the new year. Lot going on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni in Glasgow", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing engineering", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving him up", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move to the Leeds site", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t108-051", "text": "Long chat with Sadia. She's finally handing in her notice tomorrow, been building up to it for months. New role at the hospice starts 30 November 2026, it's less money but she says she'll actually be happy. Her manager doesn't know yet and she's dreading the conversation. Her sister Chioma's helping her draft the letter tonight. Remind me to text her tomorrow afternoon once it's done.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "handing in her notice", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "New role at the hospice", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "30 November 2026", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the conversation", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow afternoon once it's done", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t108-055", "text": "Moira's leaving the choir, the rehearsals clash with her new night shifts.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Moira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving the choir", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "night shifts", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t108-057", "text": "Nadia is pregnant!! Due mid May 2027. Her partner Jonah told me before she did lol, she was mortified", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "mid May 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jonah", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "mortified", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t108-059", "text": "Paolo's starting a new job next Wednesday. He said his old boss threw him a surprise send-off at the pub and cried. Need to ask Paolo after his first week how he's finding it. Also his partner Kiara's birthday is the week after, and she's dropping hints about a fancy coffee grinder.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Paolo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise send-off at the pub", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Paolo", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Paolo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after his first week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dropping hints about a fancy coffee grinder", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p3"}]}
